// steps <= maxSteps nor the final length/cost bounds. The fix is minimal:
// bound symbolBudget by the remaining budget maxSteps - steps (while still
// forcing it to be at least 1 when that branch is reachable). The rest of the
// strategy is unchanged.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
